Package: shakerproxy-host
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ShakerProxy Maintainers <maintainers@shakerproxy.invalid>
Depends: adduser, curl, ieee-data, iproute2, iptables, jq, kea-dhcp4-server (>= 2.4.1), netplan.io, nftables, openssl, procps, python3-minimal, systemd (>= 255), util-linux, wireshark-common (>= 4.2.2), zstd
Recommends: hostapd (>= 2:2.10), iw, radvd
Description: ShakerProxy privileged host boundary
 Small, auditable host daemon, local CLI, and independent rollback watchdog for
 the ShakerProxy authorized traffic-analysis appliance. Network changes still
 require a reviewed, health-checked, explicitly confirmed transaction.
